{"ref":"BDB, נָפַשׁ","hw":"נָפַשׁ","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">נָפַשׁ</span>]</big>  <strong>vb.denom. (</strong>cf. Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܢܰܦܶܫ</span> <em>refresh;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܶܬܢܦܶܫ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܶܬܢܰܦܰܫ</span> <em>be refreshed;</em> Ethiopic ነፍሰ <strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Niph.</strong>  Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִנָּפֵשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:12\" href=\"/Exodus.23.12\">Ex 23:12</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 16:14\" href=\"/II_Samuel.16.14\">2 S 16:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּנָּפַ֑שׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 31:17\" href=\"/Exodus.31.17\">Ex 31:17</a> (P);—<em>take breath, refresh oneself</em>.","next":"BDB, נָפִישׁ","prev":"BDB, נֶ֫פֶשׁ"}